  "result": "{\"seen_before\": true, \"matches\": [\"PowerToys#28596\", \"PowerToys#21313\", \"PowerToys#33200\"], \"answer\": \"This feature has been requested several times before (a temporary keyboard lock for cleaning or avoiding accidental keystrokes). The PowerToys team has said there are no plans to implement it: in #28596 they suggested locking or turning off the computer instead, and in #21313 they again said there are currently no plans. Suggested workarounds from those tickets are to lock the PC or put it to sleep, unplug a USB keyboard, or turn off Bluetooth or remove the batteries of a wireless keyboard. A third-party keyboard-lock or keyboard-clean tool (for example the one linked in #21313) can also do this. You can add a thumbs-up to #21313 if you want to show interest, but no native feature is currently planned.\"}",
